# Canonical byte policy for this fixture package (narrowly scoped to
# fixtures/reader-workload and everything below it).
#
# Exact file hashes and LF-only golden strings are part of the fixture
# contract, so text files are stored and checked out with LF regardless
# of core.autocrlf; fonts and the PNG are binary and never normalized.
# Nothing outside this directory is affected.

* text=auto eol=lf
*.ttf binary
*.png binary
